Calendar data attribution
The calendar manifests in data/company-calendar are transformed from government
office calendar data published by the Directorate-General of Personnel
Administration, Executive Yuan (DGPA). Each manifest retains the source title,
document identifier, publication date, URL and source-content hash.
Sources:
 https://www.dgpa.gov.tw/information?pid=12573&uid=41
 https://www.dgpa.gov.tw/information?pid=12982&uid=41
Reuse declaration:
 https://www.dgpa.gov.tw/archive?uid=75
The JSON representation is an application adaptation; no agency endorsement is
claimed. Calendar data is not relicensed by the project's Apache-2.0 license.
